---
import InformationLayout from '../layouts/InformationLayout.astro';
import { site, legal, policyDetailsPending } from '../config/site';
const bookingUrl = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_BOOKING_URL || '';
const enquiryEnabled = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_ENQUIRY_ENABLED === 'true';
const contents = [
  { id: 'operator', title: 'Who we are' },
  { id: 'brief', title: 'Your project brief' },
  { id: 'storage', title: 'Cookies & local storage' },
  { id: 'hosting', title: 'Hosting & security' },
  { id: 'sharing', title: 'Sharing & retention' },
  { id: 'rights', title: 'Your rights & contact' },
];
---
<InformationLayout title="Privacy & Cookies" eyebrow="Your information" description="How this website handles your information, project brief and display preferences." contents={contents} updated={legal.updated} draft={policyDetailsPending}>
  <section id="operator" aria-labelledby="operator-heading"><h2 id="operator-heading">Who we are</h2><p>{site.studio.introduction}</p>{legal.operatorName ? <p>The person or people responsible for personal information handled through this website: <strong>{legal.operatorName}</strong>.</p> : <p>The legal operator’s identity and contact details will be added before public launch.</p>}{legal.contactAddress && <p>Contact address: {legal.contactAddress}</p>}{site.email && <p>Privacy contact: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a></p>}</section>
  <section id="brief" aria-labelledby="brief-heading"><h2 id="brief-heading">Your project brief</h2><p>The brief form asks for your name and email, an optional phone number, and your business type, budget range and timeline. Your entries are held in this page’s memory. Reviewing or downloading the brief does not send those entries to {site.name}, book a call or subscribe you to marketing.</p><p>The form does not save your entries in cookies or local storage. A downloaded brief is a text file on your device; you choose whether to keep, delete or share it. Your browser may separately offer autofill or save downloads according to your browser settings.</p>{enquiryEnabled && <p>When you choose “Send your brief”, the details in your brief are sent from this website to our inbox at {site.email}. We use them to reply to you about your project. The message is delivered by our email delivery provider, <a href={site.enquiry.provider.privacyUrl}>{site.enquiry.provider.name}</a>.</p>}{site.email && <p>The “Email your brief” link opens an email draft in your chosen email application. You decide whether to send it. If you send it, we receive the information in that message and your sender details.</p>}{bookingUrl && <p>The booking link opens an external calendar at <a href={bookingUrl} rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">{new URL(bookingUrl).hostname}</a>. Your brief is not automatically passed to that provider. Information you enter there is handled under its privacy notice, and a booking is only completed through that service.</p>}<p>If you contact us directly, we use the information you choose to share to respond and discuss your requested project. Depending on the circumstances, this is to take steps toward a contract at your request, or for our legitimate interest in responding to business enquiries. It does not automatically authorize unrelated marketing.</p></section>
  <section id="storage" aria-labelledby="storage-heading"><h2 id="storage-heading">Cookies &amp; local storage</h2><p>We do not use advertising pixels or cross-site tracking. Fonts and website images are served with the site.</p><p>Our host, Cloudflare, counts page views and measures page speed with <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/web-analytics/">Cloudflare Web Analytics</a>. It sets no cookies, stores nothing on your device, does not fingerprint you and does not keep your IP address. It shows us totals, such as visits per page and the referring website, not individual visitors. Our legitimate interest is understanding how the website is used and keeping it fast.</p><p>When you download Lupo, our Mac app, from <a href="/lupo/">its page</a>, our server adds one to a download count in Cloudflare Workers Analytics Engine, together with the version you downloaded. The count records nothing about you: no IP address, cookie, device details or the page you came from. Cloudflare keeps the counts for three months. Our legitimate interest is knowing how often Lupo is downloaded.</p><dl class="information-facts"><div><dt>Stored item</dt><dd><code>{site.themeStorageKey}</code></dd></div><div><dt>Technology</dt><dd>Browser local storage on this website’s origin.</dd></div><div><dt>Purpose</dt><dd>Remember your selected Auto, Light or Dark display preference. It is not used to identify or track you.</dd></div><div><dt>When saved</dt><dd>When you change the theme selector. The saved value is read on later visits.</dd></div><div><dt>Duration</dt><dd>No automatic expiry. It remains until replaced, cleared by you or removed by your browser.</dd></div><div><dt>Your control</dt><dd>Choose Auto to follow your device’s theme. Remove this website’s saved data in your browser settings to clear the stored preference. If storage is blocked, the selector still works for the current page.</dd></div></dl><dl class="information-facts"><div><dt>Stored item</dt><dd><code>{site.consent.storageKey}</code></dd></div><div><dt>Technology</dt><dd>Browser local storage on this website’s origin.</dd></div><div><dt>Purpose</dt><dd>Remember your answer to the cookie notice, so it is not shown on every page. It holds only that answer and when you gave it.</dd></div><div><dt>When saved</dt><dd>When you answer the cookie notice.</dd></div><div><dt>Duration</dt><dd>No automatic expiry. It remains until replaced, cleared by you or removed by your browser. If the storage we use changes, the notice asks again.</dd></div><div><dt>Your control</dt><dd>Use “Cookie settings” at the foot of any page to see the notice again, or remove this website’s saved data in your browser settings.</dd></div></dl><p>We treat these two items as functional storage. They are not used to identify or track you. No advertising is installed and our visitor statistics store nothing on your device, so the cookie notice informs rather than asks. If our use of storage or tracking changes, we will update this notice and obtain consent where required, before any optional storage is used.</p></section>
  <section id="hosting" aria-labelledby="hosting-heading"><h2 id="hosting-heading">Hosting &amp; security</h2><p>Loading a website connects your browser to its hosting provider. Technical information such as your IP address, requested page, request time and browser information may be processed to deliver pages, troubleshoot errors and protect the service. Our legitimate interest is operating a secure and reliable website.</p>{legal.hostingProvider ? <p>Hosting provider: <a href={legal.hostingPrivacyUrl}>{legal.hostingProvider}</a>.</p> : <p>The hosting provider and its privacy information will be identified before public launch.</p>}{legal.hostingLogRetention ? <p>Hosting log retention: {legal.hostingLogRetention}</p> : <p>Hosting log retention is being confirmed with the provider.</p>}</section>
  <section id="sharing" aria-labelledby="sharing-heading"><h2 id="sharing-heading">Sharing &amp; retention</h2><p>{enquiryEnabled ? `Form entries leave your browser only when you choose “Send your brief”; ${site.enquiry.provider.name} then delivers them to our inbox.` : 'Form entries are not delivered to a server by the brief form.'} Files you download remain under your control. When you choose to email us or use an external booking service, the email or calendar provider also processes information needed for that service.</p>{site.email && <p>Our inbox uses {site.emailProvider.name}, provided by Google. See <a href={site.emailProvider.privacyUrl}>Google’s privacy notice</a> for its handling of email and related service information.</p>}{legal.enquiryRetention ? <p>Enquiry retention: {legal.enquiryRetention}</p> : <p>The retention period for received enquiries is being finalized before public launch.</p>}{legal.processingLocationsAndTransfers ? <p>{legal.processingLocationsAndTransfers}</p> : <p>Provider processing locations and any safeguards for international transfers are being confirmed before public launch.</p>}<p>We do not sell the information you share with us. Information may be disclosed when required by applicable law. We do not use this website for automated decisions or profiling.</p></section>
  <section id="rights" aria-labelledby="rights-heading"><h2 id="rights-heading">Your rights &amp; contact</h2><p>Depending on the law that applies, you may request access, correction, deletion, restriction or portability of your personal information, or object to processing based on legitimate interests. Where processing relies on consent, you may withdraw that consent without affecting earlier lawful processing.</p>{site.email ? <p>Send privacy requests to <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>. Please describe your request; we may need enough information to verify your identity.</p> : <p>A working email for privacy requests will be published before public launch. The local brief form does not deliver privacy requests.</p>}<p>You may complain to the competent data protection authority. For processing subject to Bosnia and Herzegovina’s data protection law, see the <a href="https://www.azlp.ba/">Agency for Personal Data Protection in Bosnia and Herzegovina</a>. Other rights and regulators may apply to your circumstances.</p><p>We will update this notice when our data-handling practices change. The date above identifies the current version.</p></section>
</InformationLayout>
